                                "sense_id": "33625a41-2997-3c43-ab39-e76bc94dadd4",
                                "text": "1996 Bose-Einstein Condensation: An Introduction\nBut due to the indistinguishability of the particles in the sample, it describes a decay mechanism that occurs for all N atoms simultaneously."
                            }
